Security in Financial Data: Vulnerable payout settings.
Scalable Management: Difficulties in auditing thousands of micro-tasks.
NexusGrid solves these using Biometric Identity Pulses, Encrypted Identity Vaults, and a Double-Locked Referral Protocol.
