5. Core System Logic
I. The Referral Protocol ($50 Bonus)
To ensure organic growth of high-quality contributors, we implemented a referral logic where:
A user is limited to 3 successful referrals.
The reward ($50.00) is only triggered when the recruit submits their first valid task.
Double-Lock Check: The system verifies the count during signup and again inside the database transaction during payout to prevent race-condition exploits.
II. Security: The Identity Vault
Financial data is protected behind an "Identity Vault."
Users cannot see or edit payout details (PayPal/Bank) without a secondary challenge.
Verification: The system transmits a 6-digit OTP to the registered email. Field modification is only enabled upon valid OTP verification.
III. Trusted Device Authentication
To balance UX and security, the system uses a Device Fingerprinting approach:
Upon the first login, an email OTP is mandatory.
After verification, a nexus_device_trust token is issued as a secure cookie (30 days).
Subsequent logins from that specific browser skip the OTP phase.
IV. Task Architecture
NexusGrid uses a JSON-based dynamic content loader.
Preference Ranking: Uses a A/B side-by-side comparison UI.
Fact Checking: Requires mandatory URL evidence submission.
Validation: High-pay tasks (> $10) are automatically flagged for "Suspicious Speed" if submitted in under 60 seconds.
6. Deployment & Hosting Strategy
Infrastructure: The application is hosted in a cross-domain environment.
Backend: Hosted on Render, utilizing a Node.js runtime. We use cron-job.org to ping the health-check endpoint every 14 minutes, preventing the free-tier instance from sleeping.
Frontend: Hosted on Vercel with custom domain SSL certificates.
Networking: Cross-Origin Resource Sharing (CORS) is strictly limited to authorized subdomains (nexugrid.site, ops.nexugrid.site) with credentials: true to allow secure session cookies.
7. Conclusion
NexusGrid demonstrates a comprehensive understanding of modern web security, database integrity, and user experience. It provides a viable, production-ready solution for the growing AI data-labeling industry.
